    {
      "id": "claim_cfcb516eadd04b31a8028dfdcb9a12ae",
      "statement": "publish_review posts eligible findings as a single GitHub PR Review with inline comments (path+line+side, metadata marker, optional fenced suggestion block) and a host-formatted summary body; on a re-review it drops already-surfaced findings so only net-new findings are posted.",
